{"bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapter":{"bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","chapterSlug":"ch11","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionCount":22,"questions":[{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0001","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":1,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-01.webp","x":194,"y":439,"width":1026,"height":253,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":682,"width":1160,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何種情形下,投資公司無法視為對被投資公司具有重大影響力?","optionTexts":{"1":"投資公司依合資經營契約規定,擁有經營權者","2":"投資公司持有被投資公司有表決權之股份30%,但第三者持有被投資公司剩餘 70%有表決權股份","3":"投資公司持有被投資公司有表決權之股份 20%以上","4":"投資公司指派人員獲聘為被投資公司總經理"},"explanationText":"投資公司持有被投資公司有表決權之股份30%,但第三者持有被投資公司剩餘70%有表決權股份,則投資公司無法視為對被投資公司具有重大影響力。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"42a70504d5eaf963aca6e7864b26380addfcbff1ac62990b1d18949d39af84ec","explanationSegmentsSha256":"068d8f675d782f64bf6e1e423aefbc358fa13c6c8abcf8c8871d7523d5b27bfc"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0002","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":2,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-01.webp","x":190,"y":829,"width":1030,"height":208,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1027,"width":1160,"height":246,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"關於財務報表由非功能性貨幣換算為功能性貨幣,下列敘述何者正確?","optionTexts":{"1":"以現時匯率換算之","2":"產生之兌換差額,將影響企業之現金流量","3":"產生之兌換差額,稱為「換算調整數」,應列為當期損益","4":"兌換差額應列為權益之累積其他綜合損益"},"explanationText":"將外幣報表換算為功能性貨幣時,應採用「時點法」,並非所有項目均按現時匯率換算(例如:非貨幣性項目係按歷史匯率或公允價值決定日之即期匯率換算),而換算產生之兌換差額,除屬於「構成國外營運機構淨投資一部分之貨幣性項目」之兌換差額應列為其他綜合損益外,其餘差額應列為當期損益。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"160ee27520ccf4e799a628c3c767868329f8d323f8c83188c7a3ec70ab9f65c0","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f0a940d8d9d67fc84e482245a983dce44959492d1a9496429ec51783952b34ab"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0003","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":3,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-01.webp","x":185,"y":1263,"width":1035,"height":202,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1455,"width":1160,"height":66,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"母公司與其持股60%之子公司的合併報表上之保留盈餘數字相當於","optionTexts":{"1":"母公司之保留盈餘+100%子公司之保留盈餘","2":"母公司之保留盈餘+60%子公司之保留盈餘","3":"母公司之保留盈餘+40%子公司之保留盈餘","4":"母公司之保留盈餘"},"explanationText":"合併保留盈餘之期末數額應等於母公司之期末保留盈餘數額。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"ec8945b59f6a79b2b3fe3460feecb439de1510ebd2e1e1b434e82686f89311e1","explanationSegmentsSha256":"4bf181bbd66e3610a1df653c1937bda3a2355745fe39ce10abd7b3aa02124290"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0004","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":4,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-01.webp","x":185,"y":1511,"width":1035,"height":161,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":185,"y":193,"width":1035,"height":206,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":389,"width":1160,"height":207,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"依國際會計準則第29號「高度通貨膨脹經濟下之財務報導」原則: 於通貨膨脹期間,在資產與負債未與物價水準連動之範圍內,若企業持有之貨幣性負債超過貨幣性資產,將有購買力利益。則該淨貨幣部位之損益,應如何處理?","optionTexts":{"1":"計入當期損益,無須單獨揭露","2":"計入當期損益,並單獨揭露","3":"減少其帳面金額,無須單獨揭露","4":"減少其帳面金額,並單獨揭露"},"explanationText":"於通貨膨脹期間,在資產與負債未與物價水準連動之範圍內, 若企業持有之貨幣性資產超過貨幣性負債,將有購買力損失;反之, 若持有之貨幣性負債超過貨幣性資產,將有購買力利益。該淨貨幣部位之損益,應計入當期損益,並單獨揭露。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"4faeaee4e28ecb41e5f9159b486a34a56acdc42927462be8580c4f5db0ddbb0d","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b041353a54dc20e851b7b2aa0629d068fbe02953009e3e0f05c4ad86ead61b4f"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0005","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":5,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":174,"y":586,"width":1046,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":691,"width":1160,"height":66,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"於合併報表中,子公司持有母公司股票視為","optionTexts":{"1":"長期投資","2":"受限制資產","3":"負債","4":"庫藏股"},"explanationText":"子公司持有母公司股票,須視為庫藏股。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"ef444477f514d21430ec8d66ef8cd7a2480ad5f71844eef8d4e932c55899c248","explanationSegmentsSha256":"58145a593e45e49eb7e0c67f11b1cde1d8e027dee5550958c64d275e2e6287bc"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0006","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":6,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":148,"y":747,"width":1072,"height":250,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":987,"width":1160,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列有關合併會計處理之敘述,何者正確?","optionTexts":{"1":"合併公司發行股票取得被合併公司全部淨資產必為吸收合併","2":"合併公司發行股票交換被合併公司100%股權,此時被合併公司即須消滅","3":"吸收合併與創設合併不一定以發行股票為對價","4":"當合併公司發行股票取得被合併公司全部淨資產,應依帳面金額合併"},"explanationText":"發行股票方式之合併不限於吸收合併;取得被合併公司100% 股權時,被合併公司不一定消滅;符合IFRS3所定義之企業合併應採收購法處理。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"01bd0ff85f0595f055c6e857bc0c0795c7515c3a83d74cb908b0fb1bfab86f79","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ac010917b9d31ca49548f853ea7d3af5284de46d7b2caddf42b9f57867abc3b3"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0007","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":7,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":173,"y":1136,"width":1047,"height":208,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1334,"width":1160,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"根據我國IFRS3「企業合併」,當收購方取得被收購方的全部股份時,收購方應如何認列商譽?","optionTexts":{"1":"將移轉對價減去被收購方可辨認淨資產的公允價值","2":"將被收購方資產的帳面金額相加","3":"按照收購方的股東權益比例認列","4":"僅對持有超過50%的股權進行認列"},"explanationText":"商譽是收購方支付的移轉對價超過被收購方可辨認淨資產公允價值的部分,因此應按選項(1)的方式認列。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"183d3fb3a6f8597d45a3af307ffdc3774e400f7f9ada0ca14a1921e6cda07564","explanationSegmentsSha256":"30da883ad72c8681ae43a38813cca3dd385d1610b2f92e3f8113fb60da096664"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0008","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":8,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":173,"y":1434,"width":1047,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1536,"width":1160,"height":120,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"根據IFRS3,廉價購買利益應如何處理?","optionTexts":{"1":"認列為當期損益","2":"計入其他綜合損益","3":"計入資本公積","4":"作為商譽的一部分"},"explanationText":"廉價購買利益應作為當期損益認列。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"2a87cb517faf20ee48b4e7dcfb238296bb4daf1ad1701f3cb3bb25df1561d695","explanationSegmentsSha256":"673e61404dfa6babb85dd154c097de8c10e3e4c0f642e22ba8923a5e985f80af"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0009","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":9,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":184,"y":204,"width":1036,"height":247,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":441,"width":1160,"height":71,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司以帳面金額$1,000,000、公允價值$800,000的不動產取得乙公司75%股權,並依可辨認淨資產比例衡量非控制權益。當時乙公司可辨認淨資產之帳面金額及公允價值分別為$800,000及$950,000,則合併當天合併報表上應有之非控制權益金額為若干?","optionTexts":{"1":"$237,500","2":"$160,000","3":"$225,000","4":"$270,000"},"explanationText":"$950,000×25%=$237,500。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"d82c16612aa05154fbee91cb76bfb173e7939e79cc2b0f7747ba582824f7937a","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a779bfd30ed536e124a982ab3df197e4b5a6d6f3aa36d33df7962c06968b21b3"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0010","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":10,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":174,"y":502,"width":1046,"height":250,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":742,"width":1160,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司發行每股面額$10之普通股6,000股以取得乙公司80%股份並對乙公司具有控制,甲公司所發行普通股的公允價值為$132,000。甲公司帳上應作的分錄何者錯誤?","optionTexts":{"1":"借記商譽$60,000","2":"借記採用權益法之投資$132,000","3":"貸記股本$60,000","4":"貸記資本公積 $72,000"},"explanationText":"甲公司帳上分錄：借記採用權益法之投資$132,000，貸記股本$60,000及資本公積－普通股股票溢價$72,000。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"224ad68e4958158eef75b881e47f48a6b50cdc0eac5270d3e34cc72d4820a610","explanationSegmentsSha256":"d2e98874b0f3a57381633f377b347da239db8b181538bc6aaeddbba16628e8ce"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0011","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":11,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":178,"y":845,"width":1042,"height":251,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1086,"width":1160,"height":111,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司發行每股面額$10的普通股取得乙公司90%的股份,發行新股的成本為$11,000,其他收購相關成本為$8,000。甲公司應如何在合併財務報表中處理這些成本?","optionTexts":{"1":"發行新股成本計入商譽,其他收購成本作為當期費用","2":"發行新股成本計入資本公積,其他收購成本作為當期費用","3":"兩者均計入商譽","4":"兩者均作為當期費用列支"},"explanationText":"發行新股成本應作為資本公積的減項,而其他收購成本應作為當期費用。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"55dfe823a8033284570a08851ad16013ee73909333adf20c1011c1e9ca15cc59","explanationSegmentsSha256":"4b9379eb09947a2b9d0d50e0e8129bd92a76c8d8c4d385f2d0f5f36a1c73a736"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0012","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":12,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":175,"y":1187,"width":1045,"height":162,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1339,"width":1160,"height":109,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"公司在處理外幣交易時,應如何將外幣金額換算為功能性貨幣?","optionTexts":{"1":"使用契約簽訂日的匯率","2":"使用期末收盤的匯率","3":"使用交易發生日的匯率","4":"使用年度平均匯率"},"explanationText":"外幣交易應按交易發生日的匯率換算為功能性貨幣,方能反映交易當時的真實價值。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"7334351761007bfa32b7c113388a8fdcacce116da5d0ebe3628a372c335fd895","explanationSegmentsSha256":"74e1fe0843b805b32368749a47975f1999a899dee39ef74e1a0ed9136e03bd57"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0013","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":13,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":177,"y":1438,"width":1043,"height":205,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1642,"width":1160,"height":46,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":168,"width":1160,"height":126,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"根據我國採用的IFRS 10「合併財務報表」,母公司如何在合併財務報表中表達非控制權益?","optionTexts":{"1":"在權益部分單獨列示","2":"在負債部分列示","3":"在資產部分列示","4":"不在合併報表中反映"},"explanationText":"根據IFRS 10，非控制權益應在合併財務報表的股東權益部分單獨列示，反映母公司對子公司的控制權益以外的部分。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e15d981737d23c92ddcbc6ca3c83b40744d1795d615b3f3d512384ba7ccb72ac","explanationSegmentsSha256":"27921a2c2f2f7e8ecbdec1ec4b5250426c04d4c352ed6aaa90fb85c74dfe6933"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0014","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":14,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-04.webp","x":155,"y":284,"width":1065,"height":209,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":483,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"母公司和子公司相互間持有債券,在合併報表中的處理方式為","optionTexts":{"1":"視為發行公司收回債券處理","2":"不需要作任何沖銷,但合併報表中仍會出現債券項目","3":"以上(1)、(2)選項都有可能,視債券發行公司為母公司或子公司而定","4":"將債券列為權益的一部分"},"explanationText":"依企業個體理論來看,母子公司屬於一個經濟個體,所以互相持有債券視為債券之收回。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"cb8bcf5f35801b55e502420d2f0a9e93975810669c8bbeb865f5a28a681e00e6","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a74805ff56d5403ef9cbbdd2ff05de88f952cddf20d9d44749b29671fbe81351"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0015","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":15,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-04.webp","x":153,"y":588,"width":1067,"height":304,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":882,"width":1160,"height":212,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"秀賢公司於X1年1月1日以現金$270,000收購東勳公司80%股份並取得控制,另支付收購成本$4,000,且以東勳公司當日可辨認淨資產之比例份額衡量非控制權益。東勳公司當日可辨認淨資產之公允價值為$377,500,秀賢公司應如何作帳上分錄?","optionTexts":{"1":"認列商譽$28,000","2":"認列商譽$107,500","3":"認列廉價購買利益$28,000","4":"認列廉價購買利益$32,000"},"explanationText":"收購成本$4,000應認列為當期費用,移轉對價為$270,000,東勳公司80%股份的公允價值為$377,500×80%=$302,000,大於移轉對價 $270,000。因此,秀賢公司應認列廉價購買利益$302,000-$270,000 =$32,000。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"86a3a16f92f855b61749158b72cdfa7b75e4ff3db4f1ff3f29b2c7a0510d257f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"0831bdf115be4835c5da02cd96ca8921e0583412625f3d5f293b0b7873301db2"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0016","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":16,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-04.webp","x":151,"y":1084,"width":1069,"height":305,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":1379,"width":1160,"height":212,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司之功能性貨幣及表達貨幣均為新臺幣,其國外子公司之功能性貨幣為歐元,並以當地貨幣英鎊記帳。在編製合併報表過程中,應將該國外子公司之財務報表","optionTexts":{"1":"由英鎊換算為新臺幣報表","2":"由歐元換算為新臺幣報表","3":"由英鎊換算為歐元報表,再由歐元換算為新臺幣報表","4":"由歐元換算為英鎊報表,再由英鎊換算為新臺幣報表"},"explanationText":"國外營運機構外幣財務報表換算為母公司表達貨幣財務報表時,若該外幣非為功能性貨幣,須先將該外幣財務報表以功能性貨幣依時點法換算之。若該功能性貨幣與母公司表達貨幣不同,應再依現時匯率法換算為母公司表達貨幣。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"ba79734c00729eef0d24a0f49ed73f4ad3ab7ceece60cb8d5514d62dd1d24a9b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"8d2bfa8526067720dbab0be3840553cdd5facfa68dbca13106e462d4d2df452a"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0017","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":17,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-04.webp","x":150,"y":1581,"width":1070,"height":87,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-05.webp","x":150,"y":198,"width":1070,"height":162,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":350,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"功能性貨幣財務報表換算表達貨幣時,通常保留盈餘期末餘額之計算不包括","optionTexts":{"1":"上期換算後保留盈餘之期末餘額","2":"按宣告日匯率換算之股利金額","3":"以歷史匯率換算之當期損益","4":"以上均包含於保留盈餘之計算"},"explanationText":"當期損益應按當年度平均匯率換算。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"f27420e567579535f5ee12a4df51f298bcc015410bb22d7263179ff6ae41fc75","explanationSegmentsSha256":"1efe2e28246163c0a65543ad144c31c6cd87199fba3c36e13dca66cd4ee81b5a"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0018","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":18,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-05.webp","x":179,"y":408,"width":1041,"height":160,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":558,"width":1160,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"若國外子公司之功能性貨幣為當地貨幣,並以該功能性貨幣記帳,其財務報表在換算為母公司表達貨幣時,下列何者應以資產負債表日匯率換算?","optionTexts":{"1":"股本","2":"商譽","3":"股利","4":"保留盈餘"},"explanationText":"子公司財務報表由功能性貨幣換算為表達貨幣時,應採現時匯率法,其中資產項目須依收盤匯率換算。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"f0230c0b289436d9ceb44f95edde29f3665e2c5fcc7ae42f51c9480b48687a13","explanationSegmentsSha256":"1585d310a278b1706511f5359f638114cc79e8881d9c1884993eeac14bc3874e"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0019","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":19,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-05.webp","x":100,"y":655,"width":1120,"height":240,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":895,"width":1160,"height":70,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"左營公司於X5年1月1 日取得鳳山公司100%股權,當日鳳山公司之保留盈餘為$1,000,000。鳳山公司之X5年淨利為$300,000, 並未發放股利,X5年12月31日合併資產負債表之合併保留盈餘為 $2,000,000。在完全權益法下,左營公司之X5年底保留盈餘應為","optionTexts":{"1":"$2,000,000","2":"$1,300,000","3":"$700,000","4":"資訊不足,無法確定"},"explanationText":"在完全權益法下,合併保留盈餘等於母公司保留盈餘。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"0a3495581825ef2be28d916c5bcab772ee8c35806be27e3ef76ade227c75dd15","explanationSegmentsSha256":"d7568845bbfc86c0549679b45a510b7c93b7222bdd6c1ae904849cbb23d47b5b"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0020","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":20,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-05.webp","x":100,"y":965,"width":1120,"height":230,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":1195,"width":1160,"height":230,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者可推定X公司與Y公司為控制與從屬關係? 甲.X公司與 Y公司的董事有半數以上相同;乙.X公司持有Y公司有表決權股份總數20%;丙.X公司與Y公司已發行有表決權股份總數有半數以上來自同一股東;丁.X公司的營收有10%來自Y公司","optionTexts":{"1":"僅甲、乙、丙","2":"僅甲、丙","3":"僅丙、丁","4":"僅甲、乙、丁"},"explanationText":"選項甲正確,公司與他公司之執行業務股東或董事有半數以上相同者,推定為有控制與從屬關係。選項乙錯誤,X公司須持有Y 公司有表決權股份總數半數者始為控制公司。選項丙正確,公司與他公司已發行有表決權之股份總數或資本總額有半數以上為相同股東持有或出資者,推定為有控制與從屬關係。選項丁錯誤,並無此種規定。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"290495c96e6f1a6e8d1f7b3208c227b906cb6fb9843ed52939530c26b65fab62","explanationSegmentsSha256":"36a6d59f732026c7715393cd5b35d48c029af2711f1aa3b778bb43bce3ebed98"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0021","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":21,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-05.webp","x":175,"y":1440,"width":1045,"height":206,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":207,"width":1160,"height":116,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"在反向收購中,哪個個體被視為收購者?","optionTexts":{"1":"法律形式上的母公司","2":"法律形式上的子公司","3":"資產規模較大的實體","4":"負債規模較小的實體"},"explanationText":"在反向收購中,法律形式上的子公司通常被視為經濟實質上的收購者。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"3e26c1b39eab0ae9fc29f94271b5494a33fd7a5ecbbc554cc97592b3f371a957","explanationSegmentsSha256":"28fd38fd1dca3c113a9c2567c6e2830a78aca3f552ce8445a02b008f1b49bafa"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch11-pdf-0022","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第十一章","chapterTitle":"第十一章","number":22,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第十一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-06.webp","x":179,"y":313,"width":1041,"height":204,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch11/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":507,"width":1160,"height":169,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"當收購者在企業合併中發行固定數量的股份作為或有對價時,應如何分類?","optionTexts":{"1":"分類為權益工具,且收購日後不得重新衡量","2":"分類為金融負債,且收購日後得重新衡量","3":"分類為其他綜合收益,並於收購日後得調整","4":"分類為短期負債"},"explanationText":"當收購者發行固定數量的股份作為或有對價時,該對價應分類為權益工具,且其價值在收購日後不得重新衡量。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"d7bb347fc9b43c9f9c96e0c75e67564b8e78ed68da09af1cc28d67057be79c54","explanationSegmentsSha256":"af4b0e877134d4b444f110fe82c405677fa6cf22e2fc94016efe60d19960d305"}}]}}
